\ S13 probe C3 — callee returns a Ref output; poly caller cross-calls it.
\ As first written (: mk ['T] ( 'T -- &'T ) ; ) the declaration itself is
\ rejected ("a reference cannot be stored"). Adjusted per that error's own
\ advice: take the reference as an input and pass it through.
import: intrinsics * ;

: mk ['T] ( &'T -- &'T ) ;
: caller ['U] ( &'U -- &'U ) mk ;
: main ( -- ) ;
